# Yuri's Revenge (gamemd.exe 1.001, timestamp 0x3BDF544E): lifter manifest.
# Addresses differ from Red Alert 2's GAME.EXE; nothing of config/game.manifest
# applies. Entries are added with the evidence for each, as there.

# The battlefield's frame limiter (called once a frame by the main loop
# 0x55D360; Red Alert 2's 0x540960 with its globals moved): src/yr/hooks.cpp
# shows frames from there at an even rate.
replace 0055E160 FrameLimiter
# The sidebar's layout (thiscall, one bool; Red Alert 2's 0x67B910 with a
# left-hand sidebar too): src/yr/hooks.cpp lays it out for a shorter screen
# when it is shown larger (--sidebar-scale).
replace 006A5130 SidebarLayout
# The tactical view's per-frame update (thiscall, through its vtable; Red
# Alert 2's 0x6A2DD0): src/yr/hooks.cpp moves the view by the on-screen
# stick first.
replace 006D2540 TacticalUpdate
